{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuro Rensoku is a fast-paced top-down action game where you become Mr. Katanas \u2014 a cyberpunk-era dark samurai. His battlefield is a fusion of neon-lit streets and ancient Japanese aesthetics. Five distinct monster types await you, each with unique behaviors, forcing you to adapt your tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield only five abilities. Every strike matters, every mistake is costly. The battles are tense, swift, and unforgiving. Danger lurks in every alley, every shadow flickers with the promise of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique protagonist \u2014 Mr. Katanas, the samurai of the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast and intense top-down combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five deadly abilities shaping your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five monster types with diverse behaviors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark cyberpunk atmosphere inspired by Japanese streets</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000220?t=1757378678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000220?t=1757378678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000220/04a973955a10b8a1f56c26f03e3a92bd840cf0a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000220/04a973955a10b8a1f56c26f03e3a92bd840cf0a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuro Rensoku is a fast-paced top-down action game where you become Mr. Katanas \u2014 a cyberpunk-era dark samurai. His battlefield is a fusion of neon-lit streets and ancient Japanese aesthetics. Five distinct monster t